%%label III. Lent et expressif
%%note B flat minor. The strings move in parallel seventh chords; the flute plays a long arabesque over harp and held strings; the cor anglais sings the arabesque over the chords, and the movement ends on a soft minor chord with an added ninth.
X:1
T:Debussy’s Missing Symphony
T:III. Lent et expressif
C:Lor, in the manner of Debussy
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Lent et expressif" 1/4=50
%%score [fl ob eh cl bn] [hn tp] tm {hu hl} [v1 v2 va vc cb]
